<title>NETHERLANDS: Draka sets 1996 stock div at one for 55.</title>
<headline>Draka sets 1996 stock div at one for 55.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cable maker Draka Holding NV said on Tuesday it had set the stock alternative to its 1996 dividend at one new share for every 55 shares already held.</p>
<p>In March, Draka announced it would pay a 1996 cash dividend of 1.53 guilders, up from 1.25 in the previous year. It said at the time that the payment could be taken up in cash or in new shares.</p>
<p>Draka shares closed at 84.00 guilders on the Amsterdam Stock Exchange on Tuesday, up 2.20 from their previous close.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000 (fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
